reast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년도 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">선발 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">합격자는 신청불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신평관에 합격 후 납부한 타 학과(광시스템공학과 및 메디컬 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">IT</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">융합학과 제외 나머지 학과) 학생들에게도 개별 연락 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">편입생의 경우 신평관의 여석이 남는 경우 선발이 가능하다고 공지하였으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">평관 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청 인원 초과로 여석이 없어 선발 대상에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">올해 편입학생은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기부터 일반 학생과 동일하게 신청가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">편입모집요강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">참고바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">◎</span> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">선발 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">: 2016-1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">차 추가모집 후보자들에게 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">개별 연락</span><span lan